        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(scripts): bound docs glossary git lookups",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where the docs i18n glossary check could hang indefinitely when one of its Git lookups stopped returning.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe glossary checker now applies a bounded timeout to its `git merge-base`, `git diff`, and `git show` subprocesses and reports the stalled Git command. The default timeout is one minute, with a capped environment override for focused repros and slower local environments.\n\n## User Impact\n\nDevelopers and CI jobs get a clear glossary-check failure instead of a stuck docs validation step.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs test/scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.test.ts`\n- Real entrypoint proof with a hung `git diff` fixture:\n\n```text\n$ PATH=\"$fixture/bin\" OPENCLAW_DOCS_I18N_GLOSSARY_GIT_TIMEOUT_MS=500 node scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.mjs --base HEAD~1\nentrypoint: node scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.mjs --base HEAD~1\nfixture: git diff waits forever; other git calls exit 0\nstatus: 1\nstderr: docs:check-i18n-glossary: git diff --name-only --diff-filter=ACMR HEAD~1 -- docs timed out after 500ms.\n```\n\n- Real entrypoint proof with a hung `git merge-base` fixture:\n\n```text\n$ PATH=\"$fixture/bin\" OPENCLAW_DOCS_I18N_GLOSSARY_GIT_TIMEOUT_MS=500 node scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.mjs\nentrypoint: node scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.mjs\nfixture: git merge-base waits forever; other git calls exit 0\nstatus: 1\nstderr: docs:check-i18n-glossary: git merge-base origin/main HEAD timed out after 500ms.\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>proof-docs-i18n-glossary-git-diff-timeout.sh</summary>\n\n```sh\n#!/bin/sh\nset -eu\n\nnode_bin=\"$(command -v node)\"\nproof_dir=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\nmkdir -p \"$proof_dir/bin\"\n\ncat > \"$proof_dir/bin/git\" <<SH\n#!$node_bin\nif (process.argv[2] === \"diff\") { setTimeout(() => {}, 10_000); }\nelse { process.exit(0); }\nSH\nchmod +x \"$proof_dir/bin/git\"\n\nset +e\nPATH=\"$proof_dir/bin\" OPENCLAW_DOCS_I18N_GLOSSARY_GIT_TIMEOUT_MS=500 \"$node_bin\" scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.mjs --base HEAD~1 >\"$proof_dir/stdout.txt\" 2>\"$proof_dir/stderr.txt\"\nexit_code=$?\nset -e\n\nprintf 'entrypoint: node scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.mjs --base HEAD~1\\n'\nprintf 'fixture: git diff waits forever; other git calls exit 0\\n'\nprintf 'status: %s\\n' \"$exit_code\"\nprintf 'stderr: %s\\n' \"$(tr '\\n' ' ' < \"$proof_dir/stderr.txt\" | sed 's/  */ /g')\"\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>proof-docs-i18n-glossary-merge-base-timeout.sh</summary>\n\n```sh\n#!/bin/sh\nset -eu\n\nnode_bin=\"$(command -v node)\"\nproof_dir=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\nmkdir -p \"$proof_dir/bin\"\n\ncat > \"$proof_dir/bin/git\" <<SH\n#!$node_bin\nif (process.argv[2] === \"merge-base\") { setTimeout(() => {}, 10_000); }\nelse { process.exit(0); }\nSH\nchmod +x \"$proof_dir/bin/git\"\n\nset +e\nPATH=\"$proof_dir/bin\" OPENCLAW_DOCS_I18N_GLOSSARY_GIT_TIMEOUT_MS=500 \"$node_bin\" scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.mjs >\"$proof_dir/stdout.txt\" 2>\"$proof_dir/stderr.txt\"\nexit_code=$?\nset -e\n\nprintf 'entrypoint: node scripts/check-docs-i18n-glossary.mjs\\n'\nprintf 'fixture: git merge-base waits forever; other git calls exit 0\\n'\nprintf 'status: %s\\n' \"$exit_code\"\nprintf 'stderr: %s\\n' \"$(tr '\\n' ' ' < \"$proof_dir/stderr.txt\" | sed 's/  */ /g')\"\n```\n\n</details>\n\nAI-assisted: built with Codex\n",
